- **Tags**: render `bot.tags` as `Badge variant="neutral"` chips, same visual pattern as `app/app/bots/page.tsx` already uses.
- **Recent backtest runs list**: the 3 most recent runs for this bot (`runs.filter(r => r.botId === bot.id).slice(0, 3)`, already sorted newest-first because `addRun` prepends). Each row: run date (`formatDate`), test type badge, `metrics.totalReturn` formatted with `formatPct` and colored profit/loss, a "View report" link to `/app/bots/${bot.id}/backtest/${run.id}`. If zero runs, show inline `EmptyState` (icon: `LineChart` from lucide-react) with title "No backtests yet", description explaining what a backtest does, action `{ label: 'Run your first backtest', href: '/app/bots/' + bot.id + '/backtest' }`.
